(carried in upstream Flycast), which is GPL-3.0-or-later. The combined cores
are therefore distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
(at your option) any later version, until a planned patch (0023, SOURCE.md
section 8) takes that header out of the build. The full text of version 3 is
in the file LICENSE.GPL-3. Our own code and patches stay GPL-2.0-or-later,
which permits this.

No ROM
------
This repository contains no game ROM bytes and nothing derived from a ROM.
Players supply their own ROM, which never leaves their browser.
